s></div><div class=\"hidden sm:grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8 md:gap-10 text-sm w-full md:w-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start\"><h3 class=\"mb-2.5 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400\"><li><a class=\"relative inline-block body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 group\" href=\"/\"><span>Intelligence feed</span><span class=\"absolute left-0 -bottom-[1px] h-[1px] w-0 bg-[#ff6600] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"relative inline-block body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 group\" href=\"/directory\"><span>Account directory</span><span class=\"absolute left-0 -bottom-[1px] h-[1px] w-0 bg-[#ff6600] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"relative inline-block body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 group\" href=\"/account-health\"><span>Account health</span><span class=\"absolute left-0 -bottom-[1px] h-[1px] w-0 bg-[#ff6600] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"relative inline-block body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 group\" href=\"/api-docs\"><span>Developer API</span><span class=\"absolute left-0 -bottom-[1px] h-[1px] w-0 bg-[#ff6600] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full\"></span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start\"><h3 class=\"mb-2.5 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500\">Resources</h3><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400\"><li><a class=\"relative inline-block body-6 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 group\" href=\"/methodology\"><span>Methodology &amp; signals</span><span class=\"absolute left-0 -bottom-[1px] h-[1px] w-0 bg-[#ff6600] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-full\"></span></a></li><li><a class=\"relative inline-block body-6 text